tem-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050615182518&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ornamented_Shield_4671ac.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an ornamented shield <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Def:29)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot).<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 67.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Many gems sparkle on the shield.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Valued mostly as decoration for its beauty, this shield was one of the few remaining respawn quests. It is now in the same bag as the crystal key.\nObtainable from <a href=\"#/quest/ornamented-shield-quest\">Ornamented Shield Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The sprite of this shield was changed during Christmas Update 2004. Before that, it looked like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Old Sprite\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ornamented_Shield_Old_0299d3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.</li>\n<li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 raised its defense from 22 to 29.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomission\">Gnomission</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1,500 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/H.L.\">H.L.</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">45 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">Only after slaying 20 Warzone bosses.</li></ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomission\">Gnomission</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/H.L.\">H.L.</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">Imbuing</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nostalgia\">Nostalgia</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/ornamented-shield-quest\">Ornamented Shield Quest</a></li><li>Quests</li><li>Shields</li><li>Shops</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["ornamented-shield-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"ornamented-shield-quest","quest":"Ornamented Shield Quest","step":"1-2","n":8,"title":"Destruir o campo de fogo e abrir o corpo","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"sell":[{"npc":"Gnomission","where":"Gnomegate","price":1500,"pos":{"x":33007,"y":31892,"z":9},"href":"#/wiki/Gnomission"},{"npc":"H.L.","where":"Outlaw Camp","price":45,"pos":{"x":32643,"y":32212,"z":7},"href":"#/wiki/H.L."}]}}